WEBVTT

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:34.430
Continuing on our strange course to
look for clues about the Claire Bible...

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:37.630
...we've finally arrived at...

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:40.290
Ta-daa! The holy
kingdom of Seyruun!

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:41.740
Under the leadership
of Amelia's father...

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.070
...the ultimate pacifist,
Prince Philionel...

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:47.640
...it's become a giant
city devoted to white magic.

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:49.410
I get it. This place
is filled with...

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:51.580
...ancient temples and
libraries of magic books.

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:54.140
The perfect place to search
for the Claire Bible!

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:56.980
Wait a sec. White magic
AND Prince Phil?

00:01:57.060 --> 00:02:00.920
That combination means
nothing but trouble for me!

00:02:01.190 --> 00:02:03.530
Hold it, Xellos.
Why are you following us?

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:07.360
Huh? Seyruun's famous soft-
serve ice cream is delicious?

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:09.330
How can you be so
blase about everything?!

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:12.230
I've got a bad feeling
about what's coming up.

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:31.420
Miss Lina! This way!
This way! Hurry! Hurry!

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:35.230
Come on! Calm down
a little, Amelia!

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:38.350
Yeah. Why the
big rush, anyway?

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.790
So I can see my
daddy, of course!

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:44.360
My father's the best person to ask
about anything concerning Seyruun!

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:47.170
Oh, boy... I figured as much.

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:51.700
Ohh... I get the chills just
thinking about seeing that guy.

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:52.970
That guy?

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:56.950
Philionel, the crown
prince of Seyruun.

00:02:57.020 --> 00:02:59.850
That giant dwarf is
nothing but trouble for me.

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:02.220
Seyruun's prince is a dwarf?

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:05.890
Figure of speech, okay?
A figure of speech.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:07.150
Miss Lina!

00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:09.220
What are you doing?!

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:11.590
You want to find a clue to
get the Claire Bible, right?!

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:14.160
Show some enthusiasm and come on!

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:17.930
If that's why we're here, why does
she have to see her father, too?

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:20.270
She's still a little
kid in that respect.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:28.100
Come on! The palace
is just through those gates.

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.080
Right, right...

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:41.890
Hey, Amelia? We're near
the palace, aren't we?

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:44.090
What's wrong?

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.500
There aren't any townsfolk.

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:50.830
And there are lots of
soldiers around, as well.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:57.530
Half-mast?

00:03:57.610 --> 00:04:01.880
It looks like they're in mourning
for someone important in the kingdom.

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:04.280
Oh, th- that's ridiculous.

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:09.240
Hey, you! Stop!

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:17.820
How rude!
Don't you know who I am?!

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.020
Princess Amelia!

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:21.790
What's all this commotion after
I finally make it back home?

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:23.660
P- Princess...

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:26.930
You came back too late!

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:30.530
What is it?
What happened?

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:33.080
I can't bring myself to say it!

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:34.110
What do you suppose happened?

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:36.610
I'm not sure...

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:48.490
Princess! Princess, it's you!

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:49.420
Amelia!

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:52.020
Uncle! Alfred!

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:55.160
Uncle Christopher!

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:58.430
I'm sorry I've been away
from home for so long!

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:00.270
Amelia! You're finally back!

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:03.070
Alfred! It's been
such a long time!

00:05:03.140 --> 00:05:06.770
The guards I saw on my way
here were acting very strangely.

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:08.510
Just what's going on here?

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.640
W- Well, you see...

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:12.740
Amelia, who are they?

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:16.650
Oh, they're all right.
They're my traveling companions.

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:19.350
Daddy will vouch
for them if you want.

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:22.690
Yeah! You heard Amelia,
so let us through!

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:24.960
I know they don't
seem like it, but...

00:05:25.030 --> 00:05:27.000
Anyway, please go on.

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:33.030
R- Right... You see, Princess...
Your father, Prince Philionel, is...

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:59.430
This... This can't be...

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.970
Wh- What's going on?
Phil's dead?!

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:06.870
It looks like it.

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:10.600
W- Wait a minute!
How'd this happen, Pops?!

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:13.010
My name is not "Pops!"

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:15.340
I am Christopher
Wil Brogg Seyruun...

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:18.280
...the second prince in line
for this kingdom's throne!

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:22.290
Huh? Then you mean you're
Phil's little brother?

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:26.520
I'm horrified by what's
happened to my brother!

00:06:26.730 --> 00:06:29.660
Hey! Explain this
to us in more detail!

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:33.160
A few days ago here,
we learned of...

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:36.900
...an assassination plot
against Prince Philionel.

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:39.300
An assassination?!

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:41.270
My brother, worried that
innocent citizens...

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:44.170
...might be caught up
in an attempt on his life...

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:47.770
...left the city on his own,
against our wishes.

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:50.010
Let's go!

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:58.850
And then!

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:12.500
By the time we got there,
it was too late.

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:16.170
There was only one thing
left in that burning clearing.

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:25.810
Then that coffin
there is empty?

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:29.580
So, were there any clues
about the gang of assassins?

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:32.990
We have no idea
where they might be.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:38.360
The enemy's hidden themselves.
There's still no sign of them.

00:07:38.860 --> 00:07:42.200
You're saying they were
after Phil specifically, then?

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:45.070
You think it could be a
plot by Seyruun's enemies?

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:46.470
Yeah, or else...

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:48.440
It's not true!
It couldn't have happened!

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:49.410
Princess!

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:53.640
Daddy couldn't lose to evil!
He wouldn't have left me!

00:07:54.310 --> 00:07:56.040
Amelia!

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:30.510
Daddy...

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:37.080
Daddy...

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:56.700
Cheer up, Amelia.

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:58.170
Right...

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:00.940
I'll find the guys
who did this to Phil...

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:04.510
...and then make
'em pay for it!

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:06.170
Okay?

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:08.280
But...

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:13.320
Oh, Amelia! You have
to get a hold of yourself!

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:15.090
Your kingdom needs you!

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:19.390
Besides, you never know when you'll
become a target like Phil was!

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:26.500
Look, the guy could overdo
things once in a while...

00:09:26.570 --> 00:09:29.230
...but at heart he
was an extreme pacifist.

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:32.680
He wasn't a guy who
made people enemies.

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:34.970
Considering that,
there are two possibilities...

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:37.610
...about who would
want to kill him.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:40.210
It could be an enemy
kingdom targeting Seyruun...

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:43.550
...who wanted a leader
like Phil gone. Or else...

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:44.880
Are you saying?!

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:47.620
Or else it's somebody who
wanted the crown prince dead...

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:49.790
...so they could
have the throne!

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:52.760
And if that's the case, then you,
Phil's daughter, coming back...

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:57.200
...and now the crown princess, makes
you a threat to the assassins' plans.

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:07.470
If that's true, then who?

00:10:09.050 --> 00:10:11.410
That's the question, isn't it?

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:19.280
Amelia!

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:20.620
Get down!

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:25.220
FLARE... ARROW!

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:40.240
What happened?!
What's wrong?!

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:41.900
An intruder! Stay on guard!

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:45.010
Forget it. He's already gone.

00:10:45.350 --> 00:10:46.540
What?

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:48.680
Intruder! There's an
intruder in the palace!

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.240
After him!
He may still be nearby!

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:52.450
Don't let him escape!

00:10:53.990 --> 00:10:57.160
There's a chance we were right.

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.600
I won't forgive this...

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:04.600
Killing my father for some
wicked personal ambition!

00:11:04.670 --> 00:11:06.870
Uh... A- Amelia?

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:09.070
I won't forgive this!

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:12.200
In my father's name, I swear!

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:16.270
I will smash this evil
with the Hammer of Justice!

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:41.400
Couldn't sleep last night with
the fuss that intruder caused.

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:45.640
Look, Amelia, where are we
going so early in the morning?

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:48.980
Do you have to ask?
To investigate the crime scene!

00:11:49.050 --> 00:11:50.210
Crime scene?

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:52.010
Investigate?

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:56.380
We're searching the place my
father was attacked one more time!

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:58.860
And I still say you're
barking up the wrong tree.

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:01.790
We should be investigating
suspects in this.

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:05.190
For example,
that guy Christopher...

00:12:05.730 --> 00:12:09.720
Yeah... Basically, he's second
in line for Seyruun's throne.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:11.960
That puts him on top
of the suspects list.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.200
Meaning our biggest
problem is that...

00:12:14.270 --> 00:12:16.370
...we can't trust the
people in the palace!

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:18.740
We have to be very
careful how we proceed!

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:22.180
If only that intruder
last night hadn't escaped...

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:24.320
We won't get anywhere
if we just stand around!

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:27.580
No matter how fearsome
an enemy we face...

00:12:27.650 --> 00:12:31.610
...with us four allies of
Justice working together...

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:33.620
...we'll have nothing to fear!

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:36.390
Would you quit calling us that?!

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:37.450
Hm? Hey!

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:42.090
By the way, where'd
Xellos disappear to?

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:44.330
Now I see...

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:47.340
Just as I'd expect of the famous
holy capital of white magic.

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:50.710
You could spend days exploring
all the temples and libraries.

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:55.940
Very well, then! Miss!
I'll have another glass of water!

00:12:56.010 --> 00:12:58.110
Would you order something?!

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:04.980
Wow... This is really something.

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:07.720
Nothing left at all.

00:13:11.230 --> 00:13:13.890
We could dig this
entire place up...

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:17.200
...and only find
walking sticks for moles.

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:19.100
What are you saying, Miss Lina?!

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:22.200
For a criminal investigation,
you need perseverance and guts!

00:13:22.270 --> 00:13:24.870
As well as a Justice-loving heart!

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:29.980
Amelia, please come down.

00:13:30.050 --> 00:13:32.680
Even saying that...

00:13:36.220 --> 00:13:39.250
...we've got a big job here.

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:44.490
It's hopeless. And while
we're wasting time, Xellos is!

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:50.230
It's all right, Zel.
He won't get away with anything.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:54.470
Even if there is a clue to the
Claire Bible in the city's libraries...

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:57.270
...the city's in an
uproar over Phil's death.

00:13:57.340 --> 00:14:01.340
A mysterious character
like Xellos won't get very far.

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:06.410
Exactly! Besides that, first we
have to find the criminals...

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:08.420
...who attacked my father!

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:10.790
"Besides that" she says...
Now look!

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:14.260
For that, we need evidence!
Evidence!

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:20.490
Evidence? In the end,
didn't Phil come out here...

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:24.520
...because he was looking
for evidence, too, Lina?

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:33.730
You mean he made himself an
easy target so they'd attack him?

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:37.220
Just like we are now.

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:40.580
Of course, we couldn't
ask for anything else...

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:42.180
...if the enemy
showed up here again.

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:44.220
The only thing
that worries me is that...

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:48.020
...a regular assassin couldn't
have taken out Phil so easily.

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:53.960
There may be someone major working
behind the scenes of this case...

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:55.190
...right?!

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:57.600
FLARE ARROW!

00:15:06.140 --> 00:15:07.700
A Monster!

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:11.510
Hm... Someone even
bigger than I expected!

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:16.180
Here I thought I'd take
Seyruun without any trouble...

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:18.920
...but you've become
quite an obstacle to me!

00:15:18.990 --> 00:15:22.620
Th- This can't be! Why would
a Monster want Seyruun?!

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:25.720
You can ponder that at
length in the afterlife!

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:27.390
Now take your spell back!

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:31.500
I don't want it!

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:38.140
Diev Volt!

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:42.510
Light, come forth!

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:51.420
Elmekia Lance!

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:02.990
Even facing a Monster,
my righteous heart will not waver!

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:05.970
Elmekia Lance!

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:10.040
With the sword
my father left behind...

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:13.840
...I shall now give you
the judgement of Justice!

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.940
Amelia, wait!
What are you doing?!

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:17.640
No matter what you try,
that sword'll be useless!

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:19.050
Which is why I'll use...

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:21.090
Elmekia Lance!

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:24.280
That was sneaky of you!

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:26.120
But it's acceptable
when used for Justice!

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:27.420
What you did now was just?

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:28.150
Very just!

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:35.260
Oops!

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:39.430
Hold it right there!

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:42.340
Creatures from your foreign land!

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:46.470
I cannot ignore this
outrageous behavior any longer!

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:51.810
Darkness will never engulf a
land lit by the Light of Justice!

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:54.450
The guy from last night!

00:16:54.520 --> 00:16:57.650
Wait a second! That voice!

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:10.860
For a peaceful future, taste the
Pacifist Crush Royal Special Thunder!

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:17.130
I THOUGHT it was him!

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:19.230
D- Daddy!

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:22.980
Amelia! Your feelings
for me must wait!

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:24.310
Yes, sir!

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:28.610
Now watch as I show you a true
battle by a servant of Justice!

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:34.180
Let's go!

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:38.560
Take this! All Men
Brothers, Hand in Hand!

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:51.640
Joyful Reunion Bear Hug!

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:57.370
Those oxymoronic attacks!

00:17:57.450 --> 00:18:00.250
That's Phil, all right.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:03.910
Isn't Daddy wonderful?!

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:06.480
Oh, I'm totally lost now!

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:09.360
Benevolent Giant Swing!

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:17.860
Miss Lina, could you
give me a hand?

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:21.400
Amelia, wait!

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:23.770
Right, right...

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:26.070
Diem Wing!

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:33.240
Daddy!

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:35.880
Amelia!

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:43.790
DADDY!

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:45.990
DAUGHTER!

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:46.760
Father...

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:47.660
...and Daughter...

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:48.530
...Love...

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:49.290
...Double...

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:51.730
...lmpact!!!

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:06.480
Hm, seems they're all gone.

00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:10.320
They vanished in shame when they
realized Justice wasn't with them!

00:19:10.390 --> 00:19:13.550
Oh, they were all that bashful?

00:19:15.860 --> 00:19:18.230
What is with those two?

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:21.030
Damn! I didn't think
has was still alive!

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:22.530
Prince Philionel!

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:27.040
No matter. It just means
I take a different tact now.

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:31.410
You have to excuse me.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:35.440
I didn't mean to cause
such an uproar.

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:38.510
What's with the "ha-ha-ha"?!

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:40.780
What's going on here?!
I want an explanation!

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:44.150
Well, everything happened
pretty much as you thought it did...

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:49.220
...but when I was caught in
the blast, I got a great idea!

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:50.830
A great idea?

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:55.090
Yeah. If this assassination plot
was really a grab for the throne...

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:59.630
...if I was dead, I could see
what the enemy's next move was.

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:03.970
And when they moved, you'd have
the evidence to stop them!

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:06.700
Exactly! But you
all arrived before...

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:09.750
...I could check out what
was happening in the palace!

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:11.480
I was sneaking a peek into
your room last night...

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:14.580
...to make sure my
beloved daughter was safe.

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:16.910
Daddy!

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:19.150
Daughter!

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:22.050
Umm...

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:23.750
Enough already!

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:28.990
And then I unknowingly attacked him.
Still it wasn't my fault.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:32.860
Miss Lina, this current
crisis may be over...

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:35.530
...but I fear the main
problem is still with us.

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:38.800
I know. There's that
Monster involved in this.

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:41.710
This will eventually
get very, very bad.

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:44.980
In other words, the real
battle is still to come.

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:47.380
Still, no use standing
here worrying about it.

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:50.510
We have to just deal
with it as it comes.

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:51.920
You guys!

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:56.050
I have a feeling we've been
dragged into trouble again.

00:20:56.130 --> 00:20:58.860
No problem! No problem!

00:20:58.930 --> 00:21:01.060
Stop taking this so lightly!
